                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN, BENUTZERGERÄT UND BASISSTATION ZUR ÜBERTRAGUNG VON HARQ-ACK-INFORMATIONEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ, ÉQUIPEMENT UTILISATEUR ET STATION DE BASE POUR TRANSMETTRE DES INFORMATIONS HARQ-ACK</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TRANSMISSION OF HARQ-ACK INFORMATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a user equipment (UE) and a method performed by the UE in a wireless communication system, the method comprising: receiving, from a base station, a highlayer signaling including information related to hybrid automatic repeat request-acknowledgement (HARQ-ACK) information; obtaining first HARQ-ACK information based on a first manner; obtaining second HARQ-ACK information based on a second manner; obtaining third HARQ-ACK information based the first HARQ-ACK information and the second HARQ-ACK information; transmitting, to the base station, a physical uplink control channel (PUCCH) including the third HARQ-ACK information, wherein the first HARQ-ACK information is determined semi-statically based on the first manner and the second HARQ-ACK information is determined dynamically based on the second manner.</p>
            </abstract>
